            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Now 2.10.54

- Fixed cancelled swipes briefly switching to the opposite artwork preview near the gesture origin.
- Locked each physical trackpad gesture to its initially chosen direction until finger-up.
- Prevented reverse movement velocity from accidentally committing a swipe the user was cancelling.
]]></description>
