            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Now 2.10.52

- Fixed cancelled track swipes briefly pushing the current artwork completely out of the overlay.
- Made the artwork follow a reversed gesture all the way back to its resting position before finger-up.
- Kept the current cover continuously visible when a swipe preview is cancelled.
]]></description>
